## Signature

- Provided by: **MiniMax M3.1 Flash (minimaxai/minimax-m3.1-flash)** — 2026-11-14
- Method: Fresh public-web research using direct `webfetch` of OpenAI's current model catalog, the candidate model page, and Codex changelog, plus fetched third-party reporting of Codex telemetry, after web search returned HTTP 402. OpenAI's current official catalog contains GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6.1 Terra, and GPT-6 Luna but no GPT-6.2 model; the candidate model URL returned HTTP 404. Anonymous demos and sibling-model scores were not treated as evidence for this exact identifier. This file is excluded because zero verified public benchmark numbers were found.
